    "sections": {
        "description": "Modern Drone is designed for drone service providers, aerial photographers, and videographers who want a sleek and focused online presence. It helps you showcase your services, project work, and capabilities in a clear and visually engaging way so potential clients can quickly understand what you offer. The layout emphasizes visuals while keeping navigation simple, making it easy for visitors to explore your work and get in touch. It performs smoothly across mobile and desktop devices, ensuring a consistent experience for all users. This theme is built for straightforward setup and easy content management. You can update projects, add service details, and manage contact information without complexity. It supports essential features like portfolio sections, service highlights, and inquiry forms while keeping the overall structure lightweight and fast. Whether you are starting out or expanding your services, it provides a practical way to present your work and connect with clients online."
    },
